<h1 id="title" class="y9">One secretary.<br>Many hands.</h1>
<div class="y10">
<p class="y11">Yorozu <span lang="ja">(よろず)</span> 0.6 is being built around one secretary on your Mac. You keep a single conversation with it. It hands the work to workers, remembers what it learns, and comes back when the decision is yours.</p>
<div class="y12">
<a href="/beta" class="y13">Get Yorozu 0.5</a>
<a href="/iphone" class="y14">Get Yorozu for iPhone on TestFlight</a>
</div>
<p class="y15">0.6 is in development and has not shipped. Yorozu 0.5 is available for Mac today, and the stable release is <a href="/mac" class="y16">0.4.0</a>.</p>
</div>
</div>

